---
args: {"arguments": "ExceptionArgument[]", "boundaries": "WaiverBoundary[]", "hearing": "ExceptionHearing"}
returns: "PolicyBoundaryTrial"
---
Group substantively similar rationales by independent incident identity, discounting copied requests and repeat submissions. Form one explicit proposed boundary change with retained safeguards. Bind trial = challengeRevisionOnHistory(hypothesis, boundaries, hearing.caseHistory), where hypothesis is the actual proposed rule text. Include rejected and rare counterexamples; if a protected unacceptable case becomes allowed, retain the counterexample and revise or withhold the hypothesis. Refer the tested question to the policy owner; frequency alone supplies no authority.
